  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Uncover the Lifespan: How Long Can a Dental Implant Last?\n\n\nSeptember 26, 2024\n\n\n#### Share This Post\n\n\nSay goodbye to gaps and hello to confidence in McLean, VA! Discover how dental implants can transform your smile and enhance your quality of life. For many people, dental implants have become a popular remedy for missing teeth, offering a permanent and aesthetic fix.\n\n\n## Diving into Dental Implant Placements\n\n\nA dental implant is a small titanium screw that serves as the replacement for the root portion of a missing natural tooth. Its structure is made to mimic that of a natural tooth, consisting of the implant itself (which replaces the root), the abutment, and the crown.\n\nDental implants don’t only look and function like natural teeth, they’re also designed to be long-lasting. They preserve oral health by protecting surrounding healthy teeth from any shifting or damage.\n\nThe longevity of a dental implant can be influenced by several factors including oral hygiene, overall health, and lifestyle habits such as smoking.\n\nHowever, with proper care, hygiene, and regular dental visits, dental implants can potentially last a lifetime. It’s not uncommon to see dental implants still functioning well after 25 years.\n\n\n## What Makes Us Special in McLean, VA\n\n\nWe pride ourselves on our approach to dental implants. Our team is committed to providing dental implant solutions that aren’t only aesthetically pleasing but long-lasting.\n\nWe believe in combining quality dental implant materials with skilled, precise implant placement to ensure the longevity of your dental implant. Our success stories show that our patients are enjoying the benefits of their dental implants years after placement.\n\nThe prospect of getting a dental implant might seem daunting, but we aim to make the process as easy, comfortable, and understandable as possible. We encourage you to consider us for your dental implant needs.\n\nThe first step is to schedule a consultation. During this appointment, we’ll discuss your specific needs and answer any questions you may have.\n\n\n## Choose Our Practice Today and Change Your Smile\n\n\nAre you ready to restore your smile with dental implants at our skilled and trusted dental practice? Don’t wait to get the smile of your dreams with us. Contact our doctors, Dr. Nahlah, and our exceptional team at our practice in McLean, VA, to schedule an appointment today!\n\nPrevPreviousUnveiling the Mystery of Implant Dentistry in McLean, VA\n\nNextUncovering the Mystery: The In-depth Guide to Dental ImplantsNext\n\n\n#### More To Explore\n\n\n\n### Unlock the Benefits of Dental Implants: Your Best Teeth Replacement Option\n\n\nTooth loss can become an unfortunate reality for many as we age. Thankfully, advancements in dental technology, like dental implants,\n\nRead More »\n\nOctober 26, 2024\n\n\n### Your Comprehensive Guide on Dental Implants: The Best Replacement of Tooth Solution\n\n\nDental implants in McLean, VA are small, and titanium posts are surgically placed in your jawbone underneath your gum line.\n\nOctober 20, 2024\n\n\n## You Are Welcome Here.\n\n\nSchedule your consultation today.\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
